A BlackStar classic. Choux pastry filled with Valrhona chocolate[ creme] and coated in shiny chocolate glaze.
Our flans pay to homage from the Portuguese[ pastel] de[ nata]. A flat pastry cup filled with vanilla custard and baked at a high temperature to[ carame]lise the top.
